    "description": "Awesome thank you! Ok a few updates if you can do them (or I can do them if you don't have time):\n\n1\\. Let's clean up the objects we're not using, if this means we just have to create a custom Lightning Console App, let's do it, we can always make changes later as needed for it. \n\n2\\. We should categorize the fields for each object into sections, If you want to take a stab at it first, go for it and then I'll do another round after. \n\n3\\. Can we add that Market Country + Market State dependant picklists? Let's use full state/country names, and only US and Canada and another option for Country as US and Canada (without any dependant picklist selection) \n\na. This can be added to Deal only for now. (Leave the existing Market field you created, we can deprecate it later if we don't end up using it) \n\nb. Claude can help seed that State/province list \n\n4\\. We should remove the objects and buttons we're not using on al the objects we've built. \n\n5\\. For the Deal, we should bring the signups list to the main page instead of hiding it under Related, I am leaning towards oyur suggestion from earlier of moving all the related lists into the main page for now and keep a single tab for simplicity sake so it's easier for them to navigate. \n\nCreated from Slack: [https://jumpr-solutions.slack.com/archives/D09DMMYMA8P/p1783442971769119](https://jumpr-solutions.slack.com/archives/D09DMMYMA8P/p1783442971769119)",
